        "created_at": "2016-03-31T19:32:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>F.I.L.T.E.R. (the agency K.N.Y.F.E. and Sargent Steel work/ed for) operates a transdimensional prison for the purpose of containing rogue meta-humans, has rather lose morals, chose to stand by as Earth was threatened and sent a squad which had no qualms about working with villains to bring back the agent who decided to actually do something about it.</p>",
